		"name": "Lighter strategy portfolio",
		"short_description": "Lagoon vault running four trading books on Lighter",
		"long_description": "\nLighter strategy portfolio is an Ethereum Lagoon vault that divides its capital\nbetween trading books on Lighter. Each book is a separate Lighter sub-account,\nrun by its own automated trading process.\n\n## Minimum equity by book\n\n- Volatility: 1,000 USDC\n- Long/short: 6,000 USDC\n- BTC mean reversion: 2,000 USDC\n- Momentum mean reversion: 0 USDC\n\nThe books have fixed equity minimums totalling 9,000 USDC and are funded as\ncapital becomes available, largest shortfall first. Cash beyond their funding\nneeds stays as USDC in the Safe. Increasing a minimum requires a manual edit;\nshortfalls are topped up automatically outside the 250-USDC tolerance.\nProfit above each minimum stays in its sleeve. Small amounts may remain on\nthe master within this tolerance to avoid repeated withdrawals.\n\n## How it works\n\nInvestor deposits and redemptions go through the Lagoon vault, and its Safe\nowns the Lighter accounts.\n\nThe vault's executor moves capital between the Safe and the Lighter accounts,\nfunds shortfalls below each book's minimum and values all accounts in the vault's\nshare price. Funding a sleeve from the Safe goes through the master account\nand can take several 6-hour cycles. Minimum mode does not rebalance profits\nbetween books.\n\n## Liquidity\n\nRedemptions use Safe cash first. Additional liquidity requires a Lighter\nwithdrawal, which takes about 30 minutes per account and uses free collateral.\nMargin in use by open positions has to be released before it can be withdrawn.\n",
